        "original_id": "01b13c60-058a-567a-a673-57377460eb9d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carrie Coon, Lee Pace, Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike\n- Films: Gone Girl, The Keeping Hours\n- Characters: Margo Dunne, Nick Dunne, Amy\n- Places: Missouri\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Carrie Coon starred as Margo Dunne in the thriller film Gone Girl.\n- Gone Girl is set in Missouri and begins as a mystery about the disappearance of Amy, with Nick Dunne becoming the primary suspect.\n- Ben Affleck played Nick Dunne in Gone Girl.\n- Rosamund Pike played Amy in Gone Girl.\n- The film The Keeping Hours stars Lee Pace and Carrie Coon.",
